# SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
# The canonical demos (#1592), redone after each milestone and recorded
# on the board: the icosahedron series, a step a GPU feature, each image
# named for its step, with the images' sums beside them.
#   bazel build //demo/canon:ico_series
# hil boots each image as it boots the ico demos; each prints
# `demo ico <n>: <name>`, its cycles every 64 frames, and
# `demo ico <n> done` after 1200 frames.

_STEPS = [
    "1_flat",
    "2_depth",
    "3_smooth",
    "4_textured",
    "5_mipmapped",
    "6_fog",
]

genrule(
    name = "ico_series",
    srcs = ["//cpu/vreteno/rust:demo_ico_%s_bin" % s for s in _STEPS],
    outs = ["demo-ico-%s.bin" % s.replace("_", "-") for s in _STEPS] + [
        "SHA256SUMS",
    ],
    cmd = " && ".join([
        "cp $(location //cpu/vreteno/rust:demo_ico_%s_bin) $(RULEDIR)/demo-ico-%s.bin" % (s, s.replace("_", "-"))
        for s in _STEPS
    ] + [
        "(cd $(RULEDIR) && sha256sum demo-ico-*.bin > SHA256SUMS)",
    ]),
    tags = ["manual"],
)
